            <ArticleTitle>Dermatologic causes of heel pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>407-16</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1016/j.cpm.2010.04.002</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>There are many causes of heel pain. Not all are characterized as plantar fasciitis or osseous pathology. Sometimes patients present with heel pain caused by a dermatologic entity. This article describes some of the most common pathologies.</AbstractText>
